nd</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">USDC on-chain</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Recipient gets</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">UGX on MTN MoMo, Airtel Money and Bank</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Typical delivery</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Depends on the local rail</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Hours</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Set by each local rail</span></div></div></div></section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">The route.</h2><div style=\"margin-top:32px;padding:clamp(20px,3vw,36px);border-radius:28px;background:#131126;color:#F6F4EF;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"min-width:520px;position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:16.6%;right:16.6%;top:24px;bo